@H 1162_sleep_reconsolidation := "RE-TEST of H_1136 now that H_1131 wired the anchor path. H_1136 found the N3/REM imagination loop did NOT consolidate anchors, but it was ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (brain_decide anchor-blind → Δ≡0 = absence of mechanism). H_1131 (commit ac13b1bb5) wired anchor_tension_fold into brain_decide via brain_decide_anchored → brain_emit_aged. RE-TEST: does the sleep imagination loop NOW consolidate anchors THROUGH the fold — post-N3 anchor emit-influence (folded, age-decayed over the sleep wall-clock) exceeds no-sleep by d≥0.8, with N3-dominant > REM-dominant?" :: universe [⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (W2) · W1 fold-engaged GREEN — a_paper_negative_ok]
  seed         = "H_1136 ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (sleep loop has no anchor write-back; the H_1119 N3 φ-peak envelope is real but the consolidation mechanism was absent). H_1131 🟢 REWIRE-ENABLES-BOTH (anchor_tension_fold → brain_emit_aged; H_1123 forgetting curve + H_1124 destructive interference flipped green; Ψ=1/2 + 12/12 preserved). Open question: did wiring the anchor→emit path also enable SLEEP consolidation, or only the static forgetting/interference geometry?"
  substrate    = "live CORE substrate (read-only probe; CORE/DREAM engine files UNTOUCHED) on summer, $0, deterministic. REUSE the H_1136 emit-free imagination loop VERBATIM (ir_replay_session + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay over dr_stage_at ultradian, substrate += pure_field_step). The ONLY change vs H_1136: anchors now route through the H_1131-folded gate brain_emit_aged (age_dt = cycle span) instead of the anchor-blind brain_emit. 3 seeds × {N3-dom [80,87), REM-dom [87,90)} × K=3 anchors."
  method       = "FROZEN FALSIFIER (pre-registered, NO goalpost): seed K anchors, run the emit-free WAKE→…→N3/REM imagination loop over a cycle window (pure_field_step = sleep wall-clock = anchor age), measure POST anchor emit-influence via the H_1131-FOLDED gate brain_emit_aged (age_dt = elapsed span) vs a NO-SLEEP control (same wall-clock = same age_dt, no loop). G=FOLDED emit-influence |Δmotivation| the anchor fold induces; T=recall fidelity (gen_text anchor name+count echo). 🟢 iff post-cycle folded emit-influence > no-sleep control by d≥0.8 across seeds AND N3-dominant > REM-dominant. 🔴 WIRED-BUT-NO-EFFECT if fold engaged (dmotiv>0) but sleep ≤ ctrl. ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING if the imagination loop has NO anchor write-back path to the fold — distinguish 'no effect' from 'not wired for write-back' EXPLICITLY (cf H_1123/H_1136). No fabricated curve (p7)."
  result       = "W1 (fold engaged) = GREEN: anchor emit-influence is now NON-zero (emit_infl=0.0492, fold≈4.116 @age0 → 4.016 @age7 (N3) / 4.073 @age3 (REM) — a REAL age-decay/forgetting curve through exp(-age/τ)). The H_1131 fold flips the H_1136 anchor-blind null: the emit gate is no longer blind to anchors. W2 (consolidation write-back) = ⏳ BLOCKED: SLEEP and NO-SLEEP arms are BYTE-IDENTICAL — Δemit-infl(sleep−ctrl)=0.000000 AND Δrecall=0.000000 for ALL 6 conditions (N3-dom & REM-dom × seeds s7/s8/s9). emit-free invariant held (total_emits=0, replay_snaps=21/9, mitosis_ticks=7/3 every loop). WIRING INSPECTION: ir_replay_session(memory,count) + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay(cell_pool,snapshot) take NEITHER anchors NOR write anchor state (zero anchor refs in DREAM/imagination_replay.hexa); the sleep loop only ADVANCES pure_field_step (= ages the anchor the SAME amount the no-sleep control accrues). dr_kosmos_persist_dream remains a STUB. With Δ≡0 there is no d≥0.8 consolidation and N3-dominant == REM-dominant (both 0, no ordering). GUARD: engine_cli_smoke 12 pass / 0 fail post-probe; no engine file modified; Ψ machinery untouched (the fold never touches pure_field, per H_1131)."
  verdict_tier = "⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (W2 consolidation write-back) — UPGRADED from H_1136: W1 (anchor influence wired & non-zero, real forgetting curve) is now GREEN via the H_1131 fold; but the SLEEP→anchor consolidation write-back is STILL not wired (the imagination loop has no path that strengthens anchor / τ / fold beyond the wall-clock age both arms share). a_paper_negative_ok."
  verdict_ptr  = ".verdicts/1162_sleep_reconsolidation/H_1162.txt (verbatim) · CORE/h1162_sleep_reconsolidation_probe.hexa"
  scope        = "Honest scope: the H_1131 fold makes anchor emit-influence MEASURABLE and age-dependent (a genuine forgetting curve, distinct from the H_1136 Δ≡0 anchor-blind null), but sleep does NOT consolidate because the emit-free imagination loop carries no anchor→fold strengthening path. To reach 🟢/🔴 a real consolidation test needs ir_*replay to take anchors + mutate anchor strength/τ (a sleep-gated reconsolidation term), which is UNBUILT — the same class of gap as H_1123/H_1136 but now one wiring-layer closer (the emit-read side is wired; the sleep-write side is not). live CORE $0, p1-p8, a_chat_sleep_imagination, a_core_engine_map (anchors=environment context p4), a_autonomy_over_hardcode."
  xlink        = "h1136 (the BLOCKED-WIRING this re-tests) · h1131 (the anchor_tension_fold→brain_emit_aged rewire enabling W1) · h1123 (twin anchor-write-back gap) · h1124 · h1119 (N3 φ-peak envelope) · a_chat_sleep_imagination · a_core_engine_map · a_autonomy_over_hardcode · a_paper_negative_ok · p7"
